1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,700
Keitaro Manager — recorded in a TEST environment: the Keitaro Admin API is served by a local emulator.

2
00:00:07,402 --> 00:00:14,859
Every API endpoint is protected — first, log in.

3
00:00:14,859 --> 00:00:20,753
Campaigns are read live from the Keitaro API: search, filters, streams and offers per campaign.

4
00:00:20,753 --> 00:00:26,706
The connection is configured once in Settings — the API key is stored encrypted and never shown.

5
00:00:26,706 --> 00:00:36,507
Resources: domains, campaign groups, traffic sources and offers — all loaded from Keitaro.

6
00:00:36,507 --> 00:00:42,026
Part 1 — Campaign Creator. Name, GEO and Offer ID, plus domain, group and traffic source.

7
00:00:42,026 --> 00:00:44,427
GEO is an ISO country code: US.

8
00:00:44,427 --> 00:00:48,583
Offer ID: the offer that receives the non-US traffic — #10 Offer A.

9
00:00:48,583 --> 00:00:54,946
Domain, group and traffic source come from Keitaro and are validated before anything is created.

10
00:00:54,946 --> 00:01:00,900
Preview: Stream 1 sends US visitors to Google, Stream 2 sends everyone else to the offer (100%).

11
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:07,224
Created in Keitaro. If any step failed, the campaign and streams already created would be rolled back.

12
00:01:07,224 --> 00:01:11,567
Two streams, checked top to bottom (campaign rotation type: position).

13
00:01:11,567 --> 00:01:16,590
Stream 1 · GEO Redirect: filter Country = US → redirect to https://www.google.com

14
00:01:16,590 --> 00:01:21,737
Stream 2 · Offers: no filters, so it takes all remaining traffic → Offer A at 100%.

15
00:01:21,737 --> 00:01:24,962
Part 2 — Campaign Editor. Open an existing campaign.

16
00:01:24,962 --> 00:01:27,691
One offer receives 100% of the offer stream.

17
00:01:27,691 --> 00:01:32,165
Add an offer with an empty share → traffic is split equally.

18
00:01:32,165 --> 00:01:34,566
Saved to Keitaro: 50% / 50%.

19
00:01:34,566 --> 00:01:41,146
Add a third offer with a fixed 20% share.

20
00:01:41,146 --> 00:01:44,807
The other offers are rescaled proportionally: 40 / 40 / 20.

21
00:01:44,807 --> 00:01:47,660
Manual change: set the first offer to 60%…

22
00:01:47,660 --> 00:01:52,992
Total of active offers = 120% → saving is blocked. Shares must add up to exactly 100%.

23
00:01:52,993 --> 00:01:55,474
“Normalize to 100%” rescales the shares…

24
00:01:55,474 --> 00:02:00,162
…to 50 / 33 / 17 (largest-remainder rounding). Now save to Keitaro.

25
00:02:00,162 --> 00:02:05,285
Remove an offer — with confirmation.

26
00:02:05,285 --> 00:02:09,569
The remaining offers are rebalanced: 60 / 40 — still exactly 100%.

27
00:02:09,569 --> 00:02:13,600
Every change sent to Keitaro is audited: action, result and user.

28
00:02:14,508 --> 00:02:22,908
Source code, setup and migrations: github.com/Islam0122/keitaro-manager
